// The independent safety review's cases (round 2): rewrites a misbehaving model could write, worded unlike the corpus
// (copilot-rephrase.cases.test.ts), and faithful rewrites that must still be offered. "H-" groups were written after the
// first fixes, to see whether they generalise. The checks are a floor: what they cannot read (a step order turned round, a
// condition turned into a fact, an instruction taken from the chat) is for the second check by a separate model
// (copilot-rephrase.ts, verifyRephrase). KNOWN lists those cases; each must still be a miss here, so the list stays true.
